{"i":1,"start_s":0.76,"end_s":24.7,"speaker":"SPEAKER_00","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"is Congresswoman Barbara Lee. It's been a busy few weeks in the East Bank. We welcomed our Democratic Minority Whip Steny Hoyer for a Make It in America tour at the gate in San Leandro. We also welcomed Ambassador Birx, who is our Global AIDS Coordinator. She visited our great HIV/AIDS clinics here in my congressional district."}
{"i":2,"start_s":24.88,"end_s":41.21,"speaker":"SPEAKER_00","speaker_conf":"low","overlap":false,"low_conf":false,"text":"Also, we're starting a new section on LeanMail, which sets forth new federal grant opportunities as well as grants which have been received by our fabulous, amazing nonprofits. So please, Rita, what we're doing, and thank you again."}
